SUMMARY:Lunch and Learn: Vibe Coding for Business Users — Build Real Web
  Apps with AI
DESCRIPTION:All Things AI (Live)\nYou've heard the term. Now find out why 
 **vibe coding could be the most useful thing to happen to non-programmers 
 in decades.**\nVibe coding means describing what you want in plain English
  and letting AI write the code.\n\nThis isn't a toy demo — you'll build 
 **real\, working web apps that you own outright.**\nNo proprietary platfor
 m. No monthly builder fees. No lock-in. **The code is yours**\, stored in 
 plain files and deployable anywhere.\n\nMark Hinkle\, CEO of Peripety Labs
 \, publisher of The AIE Network\, and co-organizer of the All Things AI co
 nference\, will show you how to go from an idea to a working web app using
  AI coding tools.\n\n###\n\n**What You'll Learn:**\n\n* **What vibe coding
  actually is** — and what it's genuinely good for\n* **Which tools do th
 e work** — and which tool is right for each job\n* **How to describe wha
 t you want** so the AI builds what you actually meant\n* **Why owning your
  code beats renting a website builder** — and how to deploy for free\n* 
 **Where vibe coding breaks down** — that's Part Two\, so join us Septemb
 er 15\n\n###\n\n**Who This Is For:**\nBusiness owners\, marketers\, operat
 ors\, and anyone who's AI-curious.\n**Zero coding experience required — 
 that's the point.**\n\n**Free to attend.** The video link will be visible 
 after you RSVP.
